Under-indented line after a carriage return in a flexible doc string
-----
<?php

<<<EOT
  a@@{ "\r" }@@b
  EOT;
-----
Invalid body indentation level (expecting an indentation level of at least 2) from 3:1 to 6:5
array(
    0: Stmt_Expression(
        expr: Scalar_String(
            value: a@@{ "\r" }@@b
        )
    )
)
